# COMPOUNDRULE with affixed words and morphological analysis
COMPOUNDFLAG X
COMPOUNDEND E
COMPOUNDMIN 1
ONLYINCOMPOUND O
COMPOUNDRULE 5
COMPOUNDRULE BAC*
COMPOUNDRULE AB
COMPOUNDRULE A*C?D
COMPOUNDRULE (A)(C)*(B)
COMPOUNDRULE ADE

SFX S Y 2
SFX S 0 s . is:s
SFX S 0 es . is:es

PFX P Y 1
PFX P 0 un . ip:un
